onstructive peaks for nearby words, melting smoothly away as distance grows.", "duration": 17.47, "hold": 0.45, "words": [{"text": "Lift", "start": 0.275, "end": 0.525}, {"text": "those", "start": 0.525, "end": 0.75}, {"text": "spinning", "start": 0.75, "end": 1.05}, {"text": "needles", "start": 1.05, "end": 1.538}, {"text": "along", "start": 1.538, "end": 1.875}, {"text": "token", "start": 1.875, "end": 2.2}, {"text": "position", "start": 2.2, "end": 2.688}, {"text": "m", "start": 2.688, "end": 3.3}, {"text": "and", "start": 3.4, "end": 3.513}, {"text": "they", "start": 3.513, "end": 3.65}, {"text": "weave", "start": 3.65, "end": 3.862}, {"text": "a", "start": 3.862, "end": 3.962}, {"text": "glowing", "start": 3.962, "end": 4.438}, {"text": "family", "start": 4.438, "end": 4.95}, {"text": "of", "start": 4.95, "end": 5.112}, {"text": "three-dimensional", "start": 5.112, "end": 5.825}, {"text": "helices", "start": 5.825, "end": 6.675}, {"text": "Sum", "start": 7.345, "end": 7.533}, {"text": "their", "start": 7.533, "end": 7.695}, {"text": "cosines", "start": 7.695, "end": 8.245}, {"text": "across", "start": 8.245, "end": 8.595}, {"text": "all", "start": 8.595, "end": 8.82}, {"text": "frequencies", "start": 8.82, "end": 9.67}, {"text": "and", "start": 9.745, "end": 9.857}, {"text": "a", "start": 9.857, "end": 9.957}, {"text": "luminous", "start": 9.957, "end": 10.395}, {"text": "attention", "start": 10.395, "end": 10.895}, {"text": "kernel", "start": 10.895, "end": 11.17}, {"text": "rises", "start": 11.17, "end": 11.995}, {"text": "sharp", "start": 12.145, "end": 12.47}, {"text": "constructive", "start": 12.47, "end": 13.045}, {"text": "peaks", "start": 13.045, "end": 13.395}, {"text": "for", "start": 13.395, "end": 13.558}, {"text": "nearby", "start": 13.558, "end": 13.995}, {"text": "words", "start": 13.995, "end": 14.52}, {"text": "melting", "start": 14.633, "end": 15.095}, {"text": "smoothly", "start": 15.095, "end": 15.595}, {"text": "away", "start": 15.595, "end": 16.008}, {"text": "as", "start": 16.008, "end": 16.17}, {"text": "distance", "start": 16.17, "end": 16.57}, {"text": "grows", "start": 16.57, "end": 17.245}]}]}, {"id": "longcontext", "title": "Phase collisions and NTK / YaRN scaling", "beats": [{"wav": "longcontext-0-06d87c36d49c.wav", "say": "Here is why language models suddenly lose coherence past their training context length. Push a four-thousand-token model out to thirty-two thousand, and its slowest clocks rotate into phase angles the network has never seen before, triggering chaotic attention collisions.", "text": "Here is why language models suddenly lose coherence past their training context length. Push a four-thousand-token model out to thirty-two thousand, and its slowest clocks rotate into phase angles the network has never seen before, triggering chaotic attention collisions.", "duration": 16.645, "hold": 0.35, "words": [{"text": "Here", "start": 0.25, "end": 0.5}, {"text": "is", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.65}, {"text": "why", "start": 0.65, "end": 0.85}, {"text": "language", "start": 0.85, "end": 1.225}, {"text": "models", "start": 1.225, "end": 1.938}, {"text": "suddenly", "start": 1.938, "end": 2.35}, {"text": "lose", "start": 2.35, "end": 2.625}, {"text": "coherence", "start": 2.625, "end": 3.425}, {"text": "past", "start": 3.425, "end": 3.763}, {"text": "their", "start": 3.763, "end": 3.9}, {"text": "training", "start": 3.9, "end": 4.3}, {"text": "context", "start": 4.3, "end": 4.8}, {"text": "length", "start": 4.8, "end": 5.3}, {"text": "Push", "start": 5.945, "end": 6.157}, {"text": "a", "start": 6.157, "end": 6.257}, {"text": "four-thousand-token", "start": 6.257, "end": 7.245}, {"text": "model", "start": 7.245, "end": 7.595}, {"text": "out", "start": 7.595, "end": 7.845}, {"text": "to", "start": 7.845, "end": 7.982}, {"text": "thirty-two", "start": 7.982, "end": 8.457}, {"text": "thousand", "start": 8.457, "end": 9.32}, {"text": "and", "start": 9.42, "end": 9.532}, {"text": "its", "start": 9.5